@startuml activity-session
title Activity diagram: running a session with presence check

|Participants|
start
:Join the session\n(from 15 minutes before);
|Ayni|
:Mark session IN_PROGRESS;
:Open Jitsi room and shared whiteboard;
|Jitsi Meet|
:Carry video, audio and screen sharing;
|Ayni|
:Wait until 5 minutes after the start;
:Issue a six digit code per participant\n(stored hashed, expires, max 5 attempts);
|Email Service|
:Deliver each code;
|Participants|
:Enter the code in the platform;
|Ayni|
if (Code valid?) then (yes)
  :Record presence confirmed;
else (no)
  :Count attempt;
endif
|Participants|
:Work on the problem;
:End session;
|Ayni|
:Save whiteboard and attendance;
if (Every participant confirmed presence?) then (yes)
  :Mark COMPLETED;
  :Publish SessionCompleted;
  fork
    :wallet credits the tutor\n(EARNED, never expires);
  fork again
    :reputation opens the rating window;
  fork again
    :recognition updates progress;
  end fork
else (no)
  :Mark UNVERIFIED;
  :Publish SessionUnverified;
  fork
    :wallet refunds the student;
  fork again
    :audit records failed presence;
  end fork
  note right: the tutor earns no credits
endif
stop
@enduml
